  "california": "Horvitz-Thompson weights by the inverse inclusion probability of each frame's score stratum; 95% intervals from a stratified bootstrap (2,000 resamples within cohort and stratum). Cohort v1 is left out because its middle-score group was reviewed for Bombus only. The upper value also counts frames reviewed as empty where the cascade's insect detector scored 0.5 or more.",
